# Copy to frontend/.env.local (gitignored). Never commit a real key.
# Google Maps browser key for Company Master's "Shop on Google Maps" picker: a separate key from the backend's
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY, with Maps JavaScript API + Places API (New) enabled and restricted to this site's address
# (e.g. http://localhost:5173/* in development, your shop PC's address in use).
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY=
